---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { faqJsonLd } from "../data/faqJsonLd";
const title = "FAQ — Lustique Co.";
const desc = "Bridal hair and makeup FAQs — booking, trials, travel, timing and more.";
---
<BaseLayout slug="faq.html" title={title} desc={desc} jsonld={faqJsonLd} breadcrumb={[{name:"FAQ"}]}>

  
  <section class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
    <h1>Your questions, answered.</h1>
    <p>Everything you might want to know before your enquiry. Still unsure? We’re a message away.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="faq-list">
    <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">How far in advance should I book?<span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>We’re at our best with a little time — most brides book 8 to 12 months ahead. That said, we love a last-minute bride too; if your date is close, send an enquiry and we’ll tell you honestly what’s possible (usually up to 48 hours before).</p></div></div><div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">Do you offer bridal trials, and when?<span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes — the trial is the heart of the experience. It’s a relaxed, by-appointment session in studio where we shape your look together, usually a few weeks to a month before the wedding.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">What should I bring to my trial?<span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Inspiration images, any hair accessories or your veil, and a clean, moisturised face. Come as yourself — we’ll take it from there.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">Do I need a skincare routine before the wedding?<span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>A little prep goes a long way. We share a free 30-day skin-prep guide, and we’ll give you personalised pointers at your trial.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">Do you travel to my venue on the day?<span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes — on your wedding day we come to you. Travel is free within 40 km round trip of our La Montagne studio, then R7/km. Trials are by appointment in studio.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">How long will hair and makeup take?<span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Plan around 2.5 hours for the bride. We’ll send a detailed time schedule the week before, based on your party size.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">Can you accommodate large bridal parties?<span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Absolutely. For larger parties we bring additional artists so everyone is ready, calm and on time.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">What products do you use?<span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Professional, long-wearing, photography-friendly products suited to your skin. If you have favourites or sensitivities, just tell us.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">What if I have sensitive skin or allergies?<span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Let us know on your enquiry and at your trial — we’ll patch-test and adjust so your day is comfortable.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">Can I make changes after the trial?<span class="icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Of course. The trial exists so we can refine until it feels exactly like you.</p></div></div>
  </div></div></section>
  
  <section class="section cta-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow reveal">Let’s begin</span>
      <h2 class="reveal d1" style="margin-top:1rem;">Tell us about your day.</h2>
      <p class="reveal d2">Share a few details and we’ll send a personalised quote — usually within 24 hours, often sooner.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary reveal d2" href="quote.html">Get a Quote</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
